      objectReference: {fileID: 1884032470}
    - target: {fileID: 2988520914632244287, guid: 750fa1e1c54946a46ae3cbf84659c828, type: 3}
      propertyPath: dialogueLines.Array.data[0].text
      value: Shhh... oh! Forgive me. Welcome to the library. I am Connie Sonant,
        keeper of every book in Word Valley.
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
    - target: {fileID: 2988520914632244287, guid: 750fa1e1c54946a46ae3cbf84659c828, type: 3}
      propertyPath: dialogueLines.Array.data[2].text
      value: Now the words mumble and mutter on their own. I can't tell which vowels
        they're saying A? E? I? O? U? It's all a jumble!
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
    - target: {fileID: 2988520914632244287, guid: 750fa1e1c54946a46ae3cbf84659c828, type: 3}
      propertyPath: dialogueLinesAfterSolved.Array.size
      value: 2
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
    - target: {fileID: 2988520914632244287, guid: 750fa1e1c54946a46ae3cbf84659c828, type: 3}
      propertyPath: dialogueLinesAfterSolved.Array.data[0].text
      value: What to do now?
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
    - target: {fileID: 2988520914632244287, guid: 750fa1e1c54946a46ae3cbf84659c828, type: 3}
      propertyPath: dialogueLinesAfterSolved.Array.data[1].text
      value: Talk to Pip on where to next.
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
